OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'anxious' after Drumcree
OL,4,Aparade ruling - O'Neill
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fsaid residents from the
OL,8,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,9,FPortadown are "anxious" at what she
OL,10,Fcalled "triumphalism" by unionist
OL,11,Fleaders following a court ruling over
OL,12,Fone of Northern Ireland's most
OL,13,Fcontentious parades.
OL,15,FThe High Court quashed a decision to
OL,16,Fimpose restrictions on the annual
OL,17,Fparade at Drumcree outside Portadown on
OL,18,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
